cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: hermes-gate
abstract: >-
  Bounded, receipt-bound completion rail for coding agents. Runs a
  repository's own checks, records exactly which content and tool versions
  were checked, and reuses a PASS only while those bytes still match. No
  daemon, no runtime dependencies beyond Python 3.11+ and Git; it does not
  repair code, invoke a model, or authorize a push, pull request, or
  release.
authors:
  - family-names: Bosch
    given-names: Rolando
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-4896-1112"
version: 0.1.4
date-released: '2026-09-09'
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hermes-labs-ai/hermes-gate"
url: "https://hermes-labs.ai/open-source"
